{"componentChunkName":"component---src-pages-new-projects-js","path":"new-projects/majestique-residence-credo-investments-fze-dubai-south","result":{"serverData":{"data":{"status":true,"message":"Property details fetch successfully","data":{"id":238,"crm_id":"2814","search_type":"sales","department":"new_developments","status":"ready","title":"Majestique Residence","slug":"majestique-residence-credo-investments-fze-dubai-south","display_address":"Dubai South","building_type":["apartment","studio"],"completion_year":"2021","developer":"Credo Investments FZE","price":774795,"display_price":"774K","lattitude":24.945088,"longitude":55.2072018,"min_bedrooms":1,"max_bedrooms":2,"display_bedrooms":null,"about":"<p>Majestique Residence is a five-storey residential building by Credo Investments FZE in Dubai South Residential City, Dubai.</p><p>The project consists of two exquisitely designed buildings, Majestique Residence I and II, which offer fully furnished ultra-luxury designer apartments including <strong>studios and 1-2 bedroom residences.</strong></p><p>The complex is beautifully designed with utmost care and amenities. Life here is great with access to a variety of entertainment and leisure activities in the heart of the city centre. Residents have access to amenities and services such as: covered car parking, rooftop landscape pool, gym, children's playground, restaurants and retail outlets. The complex is under 24-hour security and video surveillance.</p><p>Majestique Residence offers major thoroughfares just a short walk away. Various key attractions are located close to the complex.</p><p>From Majestique Residence, it takes approximately 37 minutes to Dubai Mall, 33 minutes to Palm Jumeirah, 35 minutes to Burj Al Arab and 35 minutes to Walk JBR. Dubai International Airport (DXB) is approximately 37 minutes‘ drive away and Al Maktoum International Airport is approximately 18 minutes’ drive away.</p>","tile_image":null,"banner_image":null,"media_images":null,"image